asse privative.\nLa résidence offre de nombreuses prestations de qualité, incluant une salle de coworking, salle de fitness, espace déjeuné, buanderie connectée et parking privatif avec local à vélos.\nPerformance énergétique : RE2020.\n \nLe + du programme \nLa résidence Harmony se distingue par ses façades en bois et murs végétaux, créant un cadre naturel et moderne. Un cœur d'îlot arboré prolonge cette ambiance, offrant un espace calme et verdoyant.","addr":"24 Boulevard Karl Marx","gal":[],"yt":[],"vr":[],"logo":"https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImlzZWxlY3Rpb24iLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjg1LCJoZWlnaHQiOjg1LCJmaXQiOiJjb3ZlciJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJhZjhmNDczN2I1MDRlZDE5ZTZmYmRkMjU0OWQwN2M4NSJ9?signature=f5f627bca0be04d14bfa269083afedf6d12b92f1931feba83e0dd4aec4648e53","zone":"B2","lots":[{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":18.18,"f":"1","ex":["NE"],"ter":0,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":98843.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":21.77,"f":"RDC","ex":["SE"],"ter":7.74,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":18.02,"f":"RDC","ex":["SE"],"ter":7.45,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":18.05,"f":"RDC","ex":["SE"],"ter":7.4,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":18.02,"f":"RDC","ex":["SE"],"ter":7.79,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":22.01,"f":"RDC","ex":["NO"],"ter":5.67,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":21.98,"f":"RDC","ex":["NO"],"ter":3.69,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":21.97,"f":"RDC","ex":["NO"],"ter":9.19,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":true},{"ty":"T1","na":"Appartement","s":21.85,"f":"RDC","ex":["NO"],"ter":0,"pk":0,"pr":[{"tva":20.0,"p":100201.0}],"opt":false},{"ty":"T